The crda code has been intact for a while now, no main issues
have been found or reported. As such this wraps up its 1.0.0
release, and I doubt it will be changed for a while. To help distributions
we add an example spec file for RPM based distributions, a debian/ example
dir and and some man pages for those pesky requirements.

